        PSST -- your room goes dark, and something whispers behind you: look at it

            loadstring(game:HttpGet("https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bonellocristian78-lab/Gradish-Mode/claude/sei-qui-con-noi-ye4k62/Psst"))()

        The lights of your room go out. Three times, a black head with white eyes and a ring of teeth (its mouth
        opening and closing, its tendrils swaying behind it) comes out of the dark somewhere behind you or above you:
        "psst". Turn and look at it within two seconds and it shrieks and flees. Not in time: it bites you (30
        damage; at your last health, your death). Hidden, it does not come. Then the lights come back on.

        Only you see it. Run it again: a new one (the one before goes).
]]

